                                                                         EDIT0109
        01  HEADINGS-LINE.                                               EDIT0110
            02 FILLER              PICTURE X(15) VALUE "EDITOR VERSION". EDIT0111
            02 FILLER              PICTURE X(20) VALUE "1.1 - 206/72".   EDIT0112
