            02 UPSI-BIT OCCURS 8 TIMES  PICTURE X.                       EDIT0132
                                                                         EDIT0133
        01  MESSAGE-LOG.                                                 EDIT0134
            02 FILLER              PICTURE X(2) VALUE SPACES.            EDIT0135
