        ENTRY 'ErrProc-internal' USING Err-Message-From-Runtime.
            DISPLAY 'Error (interal): ' FUNCTION EXCEPTION-LOCATION  '-'
            DISPLAY '                 ' FUNCTION EXCEPTION-STATEMENT '-'
            DISPLAY '                 ' FUNCTION EXCEPTION-STATUS    '-'
