        01  RP-DTL4 TYPE DETAIL, LINE + 1.
             03  NUM4A                PIC 999.
             03  NUM4B COLUMN PLUS 8  PIC 999 OCCURS 3 STEP 10.
             03  MRK4  COLUMN + 3     PIC X(4).
 
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
            OPEN OUTPUT rp-file
            INITIATE rp
 
