            MOVE "<3>" TO TAGP.
            GENERATE RP-DTL3.
 
            MOVE 400 TO NUM4A
            MOVE 401 TO NUM4B (1)
            MOVE 402 TO NUM4B (2)
            MOVE 403 TO NUM4B (3)
            MOVE "<4>" TO MRK4.
            GENERATE RP-DTL4
 
            TERMINATE rp  
            CLOSE rp-file
 
            STOP RUN.
