            XML GENERATE long-str FROM rec SUPPRESS child-3
       *> If SUPPRESS WHEN ZEROES, item is not DISPLAY-1.
       *> If SUPPRESS WHEN SPACES, item must be USAGE DISPLAY, DISPLAY-1 or
       *>   NATIONAL
            XML GENERATE long-str FROM bool-area
